Every pre-existing assertion in the suite passes -- including the "direct"
(no symlink) half of the new regression pair -- and the only failure is the
"linked" half of the new symlink regression test, which builds its own
symlinked ancestor inside TMP_ROOT regardless of host TMPDIR shape. This is
the evidence the user intent calls for: "with a deliberately NON-symlinked
TMPDIR (the Linux shape) the new regression test is the ONLY test that fails
at base" -- proving the new test would also have caught this defect in CI
(which runs Linux), not just on this macOS host.

